 the deal is revived  european companies are likely not going  to go back into iran until they are  feeling far more confident that the new  situation is a stable one and there the  2024 elections is a major major uh  factor  still it is seen as a positive sign that  the talks will reconvene next week and  there will not be another long hiatus in  diplomacy shia britancy al jazeera  washington
 

